    # Parent domain (e.g. ".reliantlabs.io") whose hosts share ONE sign-in session through chunked cookies on that domain (Secure, SameSite=Lax), so signing in, refreshing or signing out on one host (app.*, forge.*) applies to all of them. Only a hosted https page whose hostname is inside the domain uses it, and never the demo host; the desktop app, dev servers and every other host keep the per-origin localStorage session. EVERY host under the domain can read the session. Unset: per-origin sessions (lib/auth/sharedSession.ts).
